; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;>Workforce & Shifts</div>                         <div style=&quot;font-size: 12.5px; color: #64748b;&quot;>Shift rotas, swaps & digital attendance</div>                     </div>                     <div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; padding: 18px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);&quot;>                         <div style=&quot;font-weight: 700; font-size: 14.5px; color: #0284c7; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;>Finance & Invoicing</div>                         <div style=&quot;font-size: 12.5px; color: #64748b;&quot;>Automated dues billing & grant ledgers</div>                     </div>                     <div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; padding: 18px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);&quot;>                         <div style=&quot;font-weight: 700; font-size: 14.5px; color: #16a34a; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;>Compliance & LMS</div>                         <div style=&quot;font-size: 12.5px; color: #64748b;&quot;>Verifiable certs & document vault</div>                     </div>                 </div>             </div>         </div>         "
